%% NEXUS_11 v0.6.0 + KETTE12 Compliance Baseline
flowchart LR
  U[User / LLM Intent Producer] --> A[@nexus11/cli-adapter]
  A --> C[nexus11-core\nRust authoritative core]
  G[Golden Test Vectors] --> C

  C --> J[JCS RFC 8785\nCanonicalization]
  J --> S[Deterministic state transition]
  S --> H[Ed25519 signatures\n+ BLAKE3 root]

  subgraph BuildChain[KETTE12 hermetic build + verification]
    B[Hermetic Builder\nnetwork=none] --> SB[SBOM CycloneDX 1.6]
    B --> P[in-toto Provenance]
    B --> O[OIDC identity]
    P --> V[KETTE12 Verification Gate]
    O --> V
    H --> V
    SB --> V
    R[Rekor inclusion proof] --> V
  end

  V -->|pass| W[WORM archive\nchmod 444]
  V -->|pass| UI[Nexus Command Center\nread-only audit mode]
  V -->|fail| X[Hard stop\ncontinue-on-error: false]

  W --> VM[vault_manifest.json]
  W --> BR[blake3_root.json]
  W --> SE[state_export.json]
  W --> LJ[ledger.jsonl]
  W --> SM[sig_meta.json]
  W --> VE[vault/export/]

  UI --> HP[Happy Path evidence]
  UI --> MF[Mutated fixture fail-safe]

  classDef trust fill:#0f172a,color:#fff,stroke:#334155;
  classDef control fill:#052e16,color:#ecfccb,stroke:#166534;
  class C,V,W trust;
  class G,B,UI control;

---
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant I as Intent Producer
  participant A as @nexus11/cli-adapter
  participant C as nexus11-core
  participant T as Golden Test Vectors
  participant B as Hermetic Builder
  participant V as Verification Gate
  participant R as Rekor/OIDC/Provenance
  participant W as WORM Archive
  participant U as Nexus Command Center

  T->>C: Verify input -> JCS -> state transition -> hash/signature
  I->>A: Submit protocol-relevant action
  A->>C: Delegate action via typed subprocess
  C->>C: Enforce operation class and deterministic invariants
  C-->>A: Canonical state, signatures, BLAKE3 root
  A-->>I: Return authoritative result
  B->>R: Produce SBOM, provenance, OIDC identity, inclusion evidence
  B->>V: Submit artifact digest + build evidence
  C->>V: Submit subject digest + signed evidence
  V->>R: Validate provenance correlation and Rekor inclusion
  alt All checks pass
    V->>W: Persist compliance artifacts and chmod 444
    V->>U: Publish read-only report.json evidence
    U->>U: Render happy path and mutated fixture comparison
  else Any mismatch
    V-->>B: Fail closed with exit code != 0
    V-->>U: Withhold success state
  end
